<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">1 PETER</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 PETER</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Pe</para>
  <para style="mt1">PETER</para>
  <para style="mt2">CCAKY KYKHEITNAW</para>
  <para style="mt2">1 Peter</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Peter Ccaky Kykheitnaw</char> hynh Asia Minor thahlang ram kya hmin takyh lang phiakute a um hae paw Khriccaaw hae kha hynh-e ccauh kya, “Pachia popaw ccungccaw hae,” cite kopaw ccungccaw hae kalan kypaw nynh thua. E ccaky nynh a paccyn huapaw tuh mih zynnaw keiccuze vawsawnaw te runaw a teing hae paw ccawriatu hae kalan thawpyanawpaw nynh thua. Ccawzeitu nynh a ccawriatu hae kha Jesu Khri kong Thehoypaw, a chinaw, thoothuinaw te yn rung lanpaw ngaehoinaw hae kha liathuinawpaw nynh thua. Tuhcihawpaw tuanaw hoi biate vawsawnaw a teing hae paw tuh mih zynnaw atyn tou cipaw syntawtuanaw te “Jesu Khri yn thua Nin” kya minmin kha lasung pya athua cih hae cipaw kha mah a ho.</para>
  <para style="ip">Vawsaw ccyh kya thawpyanawpaw kyalya thua leite Khri uccaw athuanaw hae paw langsakute a hiin kho nawlan hae kha ccawzeitu nynh a hyy hae.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alungkhu Umpaw</para>
  <para style="io1">Byalaanmaw — 1.1-2</para>
  <para style="io1">Pachia khumnaw liathuisahnaw — 1.3-12</para>
  <para style="io1">Athyaapaw hiinnaw te hiin lan hyynaw — 1.13—2.10</para>
  <para style="io1">Teing ccyh lya Khriccaaw rya — 2.11—4.19</para>
  <para style="io1">Khriccaaw zakawsangsakunaw te ryalawnaw — 5.1-11</para>
  <para style="io1">Athangnaw — 5.12-14</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beihlangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu Khri kya-e locceihtu athuapaw Peter nynh Pontas, Galatia, Kappadosia, Asia, te Bithynia ram kya phiariphiarae um hae paw khuaccong hae paw kalan ccaw kae ky oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jesu Khri kaw na ngae nawlan oh te a chiise te theipaw na thua nawlan oh, Muisaw liate thyaasah thua hae zah Paaw Pachia paccynnaw thyhte po hae paw: Thawccinaw te daenaw tuh nae kya la lungthung sah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ahiinpaw Ngaehoinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pachia te ah Bawipaw Jesu Khri a Paaw tuh thehoyte um sah! Myarya lepaw a ngaethyaumsahnaw thyhte, Jesu Khri tuh chinaw kyate a thoothuinaw liate ahiinpaw ngaehoinaw kalan aening kha bua oun puisah vae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh nanning hanlan vaawlang kya ccypya athuapaw arohthya leipaw, anungsikuh leipaw te anaanthya leipaw rho kha ccou khylan nynh thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Nanning tuh nyathyakou ccyh kya langsaku lan paccynpaw khumnaw hanlan Pachia kya-e thungnaw kyakhe zynnaw liate ccy na thua oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Nanning tuh atu lya syntawnaw aphuinphuin keiccu aho lanze sosoh nae ngaethya zemah, hynh-e kong kyahin nae lungpaw sah. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuhteze nynh maee te syntawtua athua zemah arohthyapaw sui laeze aphute huapaw ahmepaw nae zynnaw tuh Jesu Khri yn langku ccyh kya, thehoynaw, sawtuanaw te phu-enaw kha a ccou cih. <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaw kha na muih lei oh pite na sungsah oh; atu amaw kha na muih khyh oh zemah na zyn oh; ho kho um leipaw te aphu-epaw lungtuapaw khate nae lungpaw. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize Jesu Khri kya nae zynnaw nynh a paccynkupaw nae muisaw khumnaw kha na ccou oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nanning nynh na ccou lan oh paw thawccinaw konglang a ho hae paw profeh hae nynh hynh-e khumnaw kong hynh la khia hae zah thawte la ccung hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Khri a teingnaw te tuh-e yn zui lanpaw phu-enaw kong kha minmin kya umpaw Khri Muisaw nynh ccaekia he a khanpah ty hae tuh, hummou a hothe ry, tuhkhyhze paw ccyh mou a hothe ry cipaw kha thawte a ccung hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Profeh hae nynh rya a law hae paw tuh mimaw hanlan thua leite, nanning hanlan nynh thua cipaw kha mih kalan phypya athua; vaawlang te saw athuapaw Thyaa Muisaw liate nae kalan thehoy bya a ho hae paw kha mangte, tuh-e uccaw hae tuh atu nanning kya hopya athua vae. Vaaw hae nynh tuh-e uccaw hae tuh riri do lan a ry hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Athyaapaw Hiinnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nae thinlung kha paccynkute um oh lah, hawrarih lan um oh; Jesu Khri he yn langkuh te nae kalan thuakhae athua cih paw thawccinaw kha athangnaw cia ngaehoi oh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Na la ny khyh lya oh, langmawlya e pynsaw rynaw muinsan kha la ke nan vae oh, kawngaepaw ccaaw hae hawkhate um ccavae oh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Nanning ae ko oh paw tuh athyaa hawte, nanning mah nae umtu ziazae balyn kya thyaa oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Pawccecize Ccathyaa kya, “Kae tuh ka thyaa keiccu, nanning mah thyaa oh,” cite azeikuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:44-45">Lev 11.44-45</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 19:2">19.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccungccaw miakaw kha a ryalaw thyhte, laesahnaw um lei lante bya a piapaw Paaw kha na ko na ngia oh ze, e laephi vaw na um lungkhu oh balyn amaw rawrinaw te um oh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Nae minpaaw hae kyate na mue oh paw accakaepaw nae hiinzia kyate, phua te sui tahawpaw arohthyapaw uccaw hae khate nanning kha shawkhaw na thua khyh oh, <verse number="19" style="v" />ccaenaw um leipaw, athunaw um leipaw, tuutaw hawte athuapaw Khri kya-e aphutepaw chiise te nynh shawkhaw na thua oh cipaw kha na ny oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuh-e Khri tuh laephi atho mawze laerui-awde ty vae paw la thua salamah hynh-e nyathyakou ccyh kyahin nanning hanlan yn langkuh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Khri kha chinaw kyate thoosah zah phu-enaw a pyatupaw Pachia kha Khri liate na zyn oh. Tuhteze nynh nae zynnaw te nae ngaehoinaw tuh Pachia kya a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nanning nynh byaccing kaw kha na ngae oh liate nae hiinnaw kha na thyaasakuh vae oh zah, uno tungvaw ahmepaw sungsahnaw kya athyaapaw thinlung khate lu kheit te lu kheit thawmawte sungsakuh oh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Pawccecize arohthyapaw ccacii te thua leite, arohthya leipaw, ahiinpaw te zungzae atynpaw Pachia bya liate nynh na puithui oh. <verse number="24" style="v" />Pawccecize Ccathyaa nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ccungccaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">lonua hawte thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw phu-enaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">lonua apaw hawte nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Lonua tuh naan zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lonua apaw tuh akhuakuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.24-25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Isa 40.6-8</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thuasalama Bawipaw bya tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae atyn,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="m">Tuh-e bya tuh nae kalan hopya athuapaw thehoypaw bya nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ahiinpaw Lung te Athyaapaw Minphuin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ahoy leipaw balyn, hynpyakunaw balyn, thyaruhnaw, eiungnaw te thanhokunaw balyn kha ccaring vua oh; <verse number="2" style="v" />ccirarihpaw muisaw samatei liate khumnaw kya na lethung nawlan oh, apuithawpaw imua hae hawte tuh-e samatei tuh peki oh, <verse number="3" style="v" />pawccecize Bawipaw tuh thawccithyapaw nynh athua cipaw kha phe na taangtua vae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:8">Sam 34.8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae nynh nawe hae salamah Pachia nynh a popaw, aphutepaw, ahiinpaw lung athuapaw Bawipaw kalan oun cceih oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Nanning mah ahiinpaw lung hae hawte muisaw lante sakpaw inn nynh na thua oh, Jesu Khri liate Pachia kalan douccahpaw, muisaw lante silawkunaw rae khylan athyaapaw ranpibawi nynh na thua oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Ccathyaa kya,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Dotua oh, popaw lung, aphutepaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">abyapi huapaw apaki lang e</para>
  <para style="q1">lung kha Zion kya ka nung,</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw a zynpaw ccungccaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">maethya ccou vae lan khyh,” cite a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa 28.16</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze aning tuh a zynpaw nanning hanlan aphutepaw nynh thua, thuasalama a zyn lei hae paw hanlan,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Inn saktu hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a nawe hae paw lung tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">apaki lang e abyapi huapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">lung lang yn tang,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Sam 118.22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />te</para>
  <para style="q1">“Thykupawkunaw lung,</para>
  <para style="q2">khuliakunaw lungpi,”</para>
  <para style="m">lang yn tang; bya kha a ngae khyh hae keiccuze athy-apawkuh hae; minmin tuh tuh-e hanlan paccynpaw nynh thua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:14-15">Isa 8.14-15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning tuh mohnaw kyate ngaeang lan umpaw amaw kya-e awnaw lungkhu lang ae kotu oh paw a hoynaw kha siakhae khylan popaw ccungccaw, bawi phin ranpibawi ciihan, athyaapaw minphuin, Pachia ccungccaw nynh na thua oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5-6">Exo 19.5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:20">Isa 43.20</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 43:21">21</ref> (LXX); <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Deu 4.20</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7.6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14.2</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2.14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isa 9.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Langmawlya tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia ccungccaw na la thua khyh oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama atu tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia ccungccaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua vae oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Langmawlya ngaethyaumsahnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">na la ccou khyh oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama atu tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethyaumsahnaw</para>
  <para style="q1">na ccou vae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos 2.23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Khriccaaw Hiinzia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sungsah hae paw, ramccang hae te mikhia hae na thua oh keiccuze muisaw te rhawdoukuh hae paw chiisaw rynaw kha na sungku nawlan oh kae hyy oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Zenta hae nynh nanning kha ahoy leipaw ryalahtu hae hawte thethya he ae ho oh ze, minmin nynh a muih hae paw ahoypaw nae ryalaw hae liate Pachia yn thua nin kya Pachia kha a phu-esah nawlan hae, Zenta hae laku ahoypaw ozia khate la hiin oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipaw maedote, ccungccaw hae nynh kawhoitu lang a khang hae paw miakaw kaw kha la ngae oh; ahang huapaw siapharan kaw kha ngae oh lah, <verse number="14" style="v" />ahoy leipaw ryalahtu hae kha detah khylan te ahoypaw ryalahtu hae kha thehoysah khylan siapharan nynh a sawpaw uktu hae kaw kha mah la ngae oh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawccecize ahoyte cyinaw liate angaeepaw ccungccaw hae ngaeenaw kha nanning nynh zya na daesah lan oh paw tuh Pachia rynaw nynh thua. <verse number="16" style="v" />A luepaw hawte hiin oh, tuhzemah na luenaw oh paw kha ahoy leipaw khawsung nawlan mang leite, Pachia see hae hawte hiin oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccungccaw balyn kha sawtua oh. Nae uno hae kha sungsah oh. Pachia raw kha rih oh. Siapharan kha sawtua oh.</para>
  <para style="s">Khri Teingnaw Dosuinkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />See hae, nae bawi nae zua hae kha myarya sawtuate kawngae oh. A thinlung hoypaw te nebaleihpaw bawizuaa kyalya thua leite, are-aropaw bawizuaa kha mah a kawngae oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pawccecize ccungccaw lu kheit tuh atazae lei lante a teing lyakhe Pachia a ny keiccuze thinlungccinaw kha a ngaesang lanze, thehoysah lan accanpaw nynh thua. <verse number="20" style="v" />Pawccecize na cyiseinaw oh keiccu ae zia ae bua oh paw kha lungsaete na ngaesang oh zeso thehoysah lanpaw pawmou a um? Thuasalama ahoypaw rya na lah oh zah tuh-e hanlan lungsaete na ngaesang oh ze, tuh-e tuh Pachia malang thehoysah lan accanpaw nynh thua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Pawccecize tuh-e khylan nynh nanning tuh ko na thua oh. Khri nynh mah nanning hanlan teing zah, a ccunoh kha na zui ccaw oh cite dosuinku lanpaw ae cciatawpya sya oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Aning tuh seinaw rae khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">a mung te hynbya ho boi khyh.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:9">Isa 53.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amaw kha a sarya hae ze, aning nynh saryaru khyh hae; he a teing vae ze, aning nynh huraw khyh hae; hmerarih lan bya a piatupaw Pachia kha a doliaku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa 53.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Aening tuh seinaw kya ah chih oh zah dingnaw kya ah hiin nawlan oh, Khri nynh aening seinaw balyn kha thing vawlan khe amaw a pyn kya oun phupya. A vaemaw hae liate na dan vae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:5">Isa 53.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning tuh laanpi a meseipaw tuu hae hawte nynh na la thua oh; thuasalama atu tuh Tuurintu te nae muisaw a Do-oihtu kalan phe na ki vae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:6">Isa 53.6</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zu hae te Vawpaw hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuhawte, zu hae nanning, nae vawpaw hae kalan pyakuh oh. Ou tuhte vawpaw lukhakheit nynh Pachia bya kha a ngae khyh zemah, bya hopya liate thua leite zu hae ozia liate thuasah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Efe 5.22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:18">Kol 3.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />nae kya-e sawtuanaw te athyaapaw nae ozia kha a muihnaw hae liate thuasah minmin kha bua mue nawlan nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ccaankunaw oh paw tuh atolang e ccaankunaw, sangkhekunaw, sui lawkunaw te boeining hoypaw lawkunaw kyalya thua leite,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:9">1Ti 2.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />nevyalyapaw te daebabipaw muisaw kya-e arohthya leipaw puithyanaw khate nae thinlung alungkhu e ccungccapaw kha la ccaan oh, tuh-e tuh Pachia malang myarya aphutepaw nynh thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize langmawlya e Pachia a doliakuh hae paw, athyaapaw nopi hae nynh mah tuhcite ccaankuh hae zah mih vawpaw hae kaw kha a ngae hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Sarah nynh Abraham kaw kha ngae zah bawipaw cite a ko hawte, minmin mah kaw a ngae hae; nanning nynh hurawnaw kha ri leite ahoypaw kha na cyi oh ze, Sarah ccanung hae nynh na thua oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:12">Gen 18.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuhawte vawpaw hae nanning, zu hae tuh a thawzya huapaw nopi nynh athua hae cipaw kha nyh oh; hiinnaw te asekuhpaw thawccinaw rho a ccoubua hae paw athua hae hawte sawtuanaw pya oh lah, thaekuthyanaw te umkheih oh; tuh-e tuh nae sawsangnaw akhawpaw a um khyh nawlan nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:25">Efe 5.25</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:19">Kol 3.19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahmepaw hanlan Teingnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nyathyakou ka ho rypaw tuh: nanning balyn nynh alokuhpaw tuanaw hoi oh, thawccikunaw, uteno hawte sungsakunaw, ngaethyaumsakunaw te lungnenaw hoi oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Hoyleinaw kha hoyleinaw te liaru nan oh, saryanaw kha saryanaw te liaru nan oh lah, hythuanaw khate liaru oh. Pawccecize nanning tuh hythuanaw rho kha ccou khylan kopaw nynh na thua oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize</para>
  <para style="q1">“Hiinnaw kha ry zah ccyh ahoypaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a rypaw ccungccaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a munglae kha hoyleinaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">sungkuh sah lah, a mung kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">hynbya ho nan sah;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.10-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:12-16">Sam 34.12-16</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />hoyleinaw kha sibia sah lah</para>
  <para style="q2">ahoypaw kha cyih sah;</para>
  <para style="q1">daenaw kha ccung sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">daenaw mue lan zuakuh sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawccecize Bawipaw mit nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">miding hae kha do zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a nakaring nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih sawsangnaw kha a thae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Thuasalama Bawipaw mitmae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyleinaw a raetu hae kha a dou.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nanning tuh hoynaw a rae rypaw na thua oh ze, hum nynh mou vawsaw ae pya cih oh? <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama dingnaw keiccu na teing oh ze, hythua ccoupaw nynh na thua oh. Minmin hurawnaw kha rih nan oh, nae lungvaw mah saw nan sah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.14-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:10">Mat 5.10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:12-13">Isa 8.12-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama nae thinlung kya Khri kha Bawipaw lante sawtua oh. Nae kya umpaw ngaehoinaw konglang ae khia oh paw ccungccaw miakaw kha nebaleih lante, sawtuate hopya lan zungzae paccynkuh oh; <verse number="16" style="v" />ahoypaw mawtemaw nykunaw thinlung kha hoi oh; tuhteze nynh Khri kya ahoypaw nae ozia kha ae ccae oh zah thethya ae ho oh paw ccungccaw hae tuh mih maethah cih. <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia rynaw athua ze, hoyleinaw raenaw hanlan teing laeze hoynaw raenaw hanlan teing tuh ahoyhua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize Khri mah seinaw keiccu vaekheit te phe azaw lan a teing, aening kha Pachia kalan thuakhae khylan adingpaw tuh ading lei hae paw hanlan pynsaw kya chia athua zemah muisaw liate hiinsah athua. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuh-e muisaw liate Khri nynh mah cceih zah thonginn kya umpaw muisaw hae kha phung a hopya hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuh-e muisaw hae tuh langmawlya Noah she lya sanphalung sak athua lyaze Pachia nynh lungsaete a ngaw lya hae kawngae lei hae paw nynh athua hae, tuh-e sanphalung kya zyataripaw ccungccaw lu tarya kha tui kyate khum athua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-7:24">Gen 6.1—7.24</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh atu aening yn khumpaw baptisma muihsahnaw nynh thua. Tuh-e baptisma tuh pynsaw kyate athupaw singpaw kha thua khyh, Jesu Khri thoothuinaw liate ahoypaw mawtemaw nykunaw thinlung kyate Pachia kalan byakinkupaw kha nynh thua. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuh-e Khri tuh vaawlang kae zah, vaaw hae, kawhoinaw hae te thungnaw hae kha a kuihkaw kya nung zah Pachia ranglang khe a um vae.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Hiinnaw Rulaekunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khri tuh pynsaw kya tuhcite a teing hawte, nanning mah tuhcihawpaw tuanaw khate ccaankuh oh; pawccecize pynsaw kya a teingpaw ccungccaw tuh seinaw kyate a lue vae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuhcite a pynsaw kya a hoi ungpaw ccyh kha ccungccaw rynaw hanlan hiin vae leite Pachia rynaw hanlan a hiin nawlan nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize Zenta hae nynh a rae ry hae paw myarya ohhuaku rynaw, chiisaw rynaw, ruinaw, eih hoysah kaesynaw, zu-aete hoysahnaw, luathua-ae-ui lan umpaw zohtuh beiknaw kya ciakute alia vae paw ah ccyh tuh azaw vae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Atu tuh nanning nynh tuhcihawpaw alawepaw hoysahnaw kya minmin ryte na mungku vae khyh oh paw kha mih ngaeangthua zah thethya ae ho oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Minmin tuh mihiin te michi byapia lan a paccynkuhpaw Pachia malang khe mimaw konglang kha oun phykuh cih hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuh-e keiccuze michi hae kalan heize thehoypaw tuh ho a la thua; tuhteze nynh minmin tuh pynsaw kya ccungccaw lante byapia athua hae zemah, muisaw kya Pachia hawte a hiin cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia Phu-enaw elang Ryalah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawpaw balyn athangnaw tuh anae vae; tukeiccuze sawsangnaw elang hawrarih lante raeringkute um oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawpaw balyn laeze lu kheit te lu kheit sungsakunaw kha tynkaring lan kyngkuh oh; pawccecize sungsakunaw nynh seinaw pataepi kha a bongpya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Ptb 10.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Ccohku leite lu kheit te lu kheit mikhia thuasakuh oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ccungccaw miakaw nynh lasung kha na mue oh hawte, Pachia thawccinaw aphuinphuin a ccytu ahoypaw synriatu hae hawte, lu kheit te lu kheit ryalawpakuh oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesu Khri liate pawpaw balyn kya Pachia tuh phu-esah athua nawlan, lukhakheit nynh phung a ho ze, Pachia bya thyhte ho sah, lukhakheit nynh rya a lawpya ze, Pachia nynh a pyapaw thawzung thyhte lawpah sah. Phu-enaw te uknaw kaw tuh zungzae te zungzae cia Pachia kya a um. Amen.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s">Khriccaaw hawte Teingnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sungsah hae, nanning syntawtua khylan nae tungvaw acyihkuhpaw maee lang ruapaw syntawnaw kha nae tungvaw kya acyihkuh boi leipaw uccaw hawte nae ngaeangthua nan sah. <verse number="13" style="v" />Nanning tuh Khri teingnaw a neethungkuh bua hae paw na thua oh keiccuze nae lungtua sah, pawccecize a phu-enaw yn langkuh te, myarya nae lungpaw cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Khri min keiccuze sarya na thua oh ze, lungtuapaw nynh na thua oh; pawccecize phu-enaw muisaw athuapaw Pachia Muisaw tuh nae tungvaw a um. Aning tuh minmin kalan te thethya ho thua zah, nanning kalan te phu-esah athua. <verse number="15" style="v" />Nanning kyaze hum sanmah ccungccaw theihpaw hawte, miruhpaw hawte, ahoy leipaw ryalahtu hawte, mingccang hae kong a ccukuh buapaw hawte la teing nan oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuhzemah lukhakheit nynh Khriccaaw athua keiccu a teing ze, a maethah nan sah; hynh-e hanlan Pachia kha a phu-esah sah. <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawccecize Pachia innbyn kyate byapianaw kha masaty tho lan accyh azaw vae; tuh-e tuh aening kyate masaty atho lanze, Pachia kya-e thehoypaw a ngae lei hae paw kya-e athangnaw tuh pawcihte athua cih? <verse number="18" style="v" />Te</para>
  <para style="q1">“Midingpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">khum lan kou aru lanze,</para>
  <para style="q1">Pachia pawlangria leipaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">miseipaw tuh pawkyamou</para>
  <para style="q1">alangkuh cih hae?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Ptb 11.31</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Pachia rynaw thyhte a teing hae paw nynh tuh ahoypaw rya kha lawte mih hiinnaw kha a lungzipaw Raetu kalan khe pyakuh hae sah.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia Tuuphu Do-oihnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pastor athua buapaw, Khri teingnaw hae kong ccaekia athuapaw te yn langkuh cih paw phu-enaw a neethungkuh buapaw mah athuapaw, kae nynh nanning laku e pastor hae kha thawte kae hyy oh: <verse number="2" style="v" />Nae kya a umpaw Pachia tuuphu hae kha la do-oih oh. Nangsekunaw keiccu thua leite Pachia rynaw thyhte lungthote do-oih oh lah, anungsikuhpaw muenaw hanlan thua leite thawmuinte la do-oih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:15-17">Joh 21.15-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Do-oih lan cite nanning ae pya oh paw tuuphu hae kha uk te uk leite, minmin hanlan dosuinkupaw lang la tang oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuurintu Lupi he yn langkuh te, anaan kho leipaw phu-enaw bawilukhung kha na mue cih oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuhawte anohua hae paw nanning, atanghua hae paw kaw kha ngae oh. Nae balynte lu kheit te lu kheit zakawsangsakunaw khate ccaankuh oh; pawccecize,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Pachia nynh a lysakuhpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">rawse zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">zakaw a sangsakuhpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thaw a cci.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Ptb 3.34</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze accyh he yn zaw te, nanning kha Pachia nynh ae hangthung nawlan oh, Pachia kya-e a thawsaepaw kuihkaw khe zakawsangsakuh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat 23.12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luk 14.11</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 18:14">18.14</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Aning tuh nanning ae do-oih oh paw athua keiccuze nae thinphangnaw balyn kha amaw tungvaw khaleih nung oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Hawrarih lan um oh; raeringkute um oh; pawccecize nae rhawpaw Satan tuh a sia a ruapaw chindeih hawte hum vema ka laang cih cite ccungkute a khiakuh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Laephi vaw e nae uno hae tuh tuhcihawpaw riathaenaw a teing hae cipaw kha nyh oh lah, nae zynnaw kya varyng tynte Satan kha la dou oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Khri Jesu liate zungzae tynpaw a phu-enaw kalan ae kotu oh paw, thawccinaw balyn a hoitupaw Pachia nynh sosoh na teing kou oh te, nanning kha ae ccingsah cih oh, ae thadynsah cih oh, thaw ae saesah cih oh zah ae tynsah cih oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaw kya thungnaw huhan tuh zungzae te zungzae cia um sah. Amen.</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyathya Beihlangkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nanning kha hyy biate, hynh-e tuh Pachia kya-e ahmepaw thawccinaw nynh thua cipaw kha ccaekiakhante, Silas bawmnaw liate nae kalan ccaw dyntari kae zei. Silas tuh nae hanlan a lungzipaw uno cite ka tuapaw nynh thua; tuh-e thawccinaw kyakhe tynkaring lan thadyn oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:22">Loc 15.22</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 15:40">40</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Babilon khuapi kya umpaw, nanning ryte po na thuakheih oh paw khriccaawbuu nynh nanning kha ae beihlang oh; te ka ccapaw Marka nynh mah ae beihlang oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Loc 12.12</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13.13</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15.37-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4.10</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Flm 24</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sungsakunaw kya-e myngkunaw khate lu kheit te lu kheit beihlangkuh oh.</para>
  <para style="p">Khri Jesu kya na um oh paw nae balyn tungvaw kya daenaw la um sah. Amen.</para>
</usx>